        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"7bab8582-24e4-41f3-959a-2647b5e590ec\",\"review_text\":\"𝙸 𝚕𝚒𝚔𝚎 𝚜𝚙𝚘𝚝𝚒𝚏𝚢𓀿𓀐𓃠\"},{\"review_id\":\"dc326335-a991-46bd-b73d-2b1dd0a12cf4\",\"review_text\":\"The app is good and the music on it is original as well almost all the covers are available too. Loved this app. Have a suggestion to add an easy way to remove songs from a playlist by swiping right just like swiping left to add a song to queue\"},{\"review_id\":\"790dfc60-b9af-4795-aee8-c9898da7010b\",\"review_text\":\"I get what I'm looking in music can't ask more than that. Thank you.\"},{\"review_id\":\"56e62a0b-5a6b-41db-a9b9-d68fdfb1c474\",\"review_text\":\"I hate when your in the mood or feelings and 2, 30 second ads, pop up and just ruin the vibe, and also bring back the 30 minutes of uninterrupted listening, PLEASE.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e7c60ba5-1c30-4428-96b2-b2ac874fb030\",\"review_text\":\"Super app entertainment app\"},{\"review_id\":\"68498349-9388-487a-8a1d-21aa39587876\",\"review_text\":\"Great app\"},{\"review_id\":\"7633e3c9-54f2-44e4-9c16-29caad0d8e93\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing App\"},{\"review_id\":\"c13f1bcc-22e6-464d-b5cb-8fa9a3f80ac0\",\"review_text\":\"I like your app because ther is very less add\"},{\"review_id\":\"c3009df1-8c92-4b7f-8f1e-a1977af03c6a\",\"review_text\":\"recent update - automatically starts playing random trash every time you open the app (this cannot be turned off), and keeps turning on \\\"enhanced shuffle\\\" where it throws random trash music into my playlists. and i pay for premium. im on the brink of going feral and disappearing into the woods because of how terrible this update is. whatever busybody thought this would improve the user experience should be catapulted into the sun.\"},{\"review_id\":\"23cf7b22-c8dd-4f19-b37e-1f6df6fc2a05\",\"review_text\":\"After the latest update, I have not been able to use my Spotify account. Everytime I try playing a song, it immediately stops and exits the app. I was forced to install Spotify Lite just that I can listen to music\"}]}"
